      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE touches: same as A, but the message is stored ONCE;\nthe Delivery worker reads the members set, does one\nPresence MGET for 255 users, sends one push per gateway\nnode, and one collapsed notification to offline members.\nNothing is written per member. Receipts: per member read_seq.\n\nREAD touches: Sync Service, user_chats, Seq counters,\nthe group's shared recent cache (hot), store on a miss.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITE touches: same as A, but the message is stored ONCE;\nthe Delivery worker reads the members set, does one\nPresence MGET for 255 users, sends one push per gateway\nnode, and one collapsed notification to offline members.\nNothing is written per member. Receipts: per member read_seq.\n\nREAD touches: Sync Service, user_chats, Seq counters,\nthe group's shared recent cache (hot), store on a miss.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
